    "Seed kanji (controller §8: 8–12, must include 分 and 岐 for the OD-02 fixture 分岐).",
    "Every record mixes sources, which is exactly the case REQ-SRC-01 (A7) is written for:",
    "strokeCount, components, radicals and strokeSvg come from KanjiVG (CC BY-SA 3.0),",
    "re-derived from the committed SVG bytes by test/strokes.test.ts;",
    "onReadings, kunReadings and meanings are REAL KANJIDIC2 entries (CC BY-SA 3.0) and carry",
    "the KANJIDIC2 literal as source_entry_id. KANJIDIC2's stroke_count agrees with the",
    "KanjiVG-derived strokeCount for all ten characters; the shipped value stays the",
    "KanjiVG one so it remains re-derivable offline from bytes we ship.",
    "An empty kunReadings list is upstream's answer, not a gap: 岐 genuinely has no ja_kun",
    "reading in KANJIDIC2. The hand-assembled list this replaced claimed two."
